<title>FRANCE: REUTERS NINTH EX-PARIS AIR CARGO MARKET REPORT.</title>
<headline>REUTERS NINTH EX-PARIS AIR CARGO MARKET REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are current average ex-Paris   French franc air cargo rates per kilo for a 100 kg</p>
<p>shipment with volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-on.</p>
<p>					    Nov 18	     Oct 15</p>
<p>			   NORTH AMERICA</p>
<p>PAR- JFK				  5.35		 5.40</p>
<p>PAR-CHI				   5.75		 5.85</p>
<p>PAR- LA				   6.55		 6.65</p>
<p>PAR-MONTREAL			    6.65		 6.65</p>
<p>			   ASIA/PACIFIC</p>
<p>PAR-SEL				  11.30		11.30</p>
<p>PAR-NAR				  14.50		14.50</p>
<p>PAR -TPE				  7.80		 7.60</p>
<p>PAR-HKG				   8.40		 8.30</p>
<p>PAR-SIN				   8.20		 8.20</p>
<p>PAR-NOU (New Caledonia)	    39.95		39.95</p>
<p>PAR-PPT  (Tahiti)		    33.35		33.35</p>
<p>			   MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p>PAR-DXB				   5.25		 5.35</p>
<p>			   INDIAN OCEAN</p>
<p>PAR-RUN (Reunion)		    21.30		21.15</p>
<p>	   FRENCH WEST INDIES</p>
<p>PAR/FDF/PTP			    15.00		14.70</p>
<p>	    AFRICA</p>
<p>PAR-JNB				  14.10		14.30</p>
<p>	   The rates quoted in this report were obtained by</p>
<p>Reuters on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller cargo agents based at the Paris airports.</p>
<p>	   All prices are quoted in French francs.</p>
<p>	  The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a</p>
<p>range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. -- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
